@startuml Edit file flow
title Edit file flow

actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Storage Service" as Storage
participant "Metadata Service" as Metadata
database "Metadata DB" as MetadataDB
participant "Permission Service" as Permission
database "Permission DB" as PermissionDB
database "Object Storage" as ObjectStorage
queue "Event Bus / Kafka" as Kafka
participant "Sync Service" as Sync
database "Sync DB" as SyncDB
participant "Thumbnail Service" as Thumbnail
participant "Search Service" as Search

User -> App : Edit file
App -> App : Calculate diff

App -> Gateway : PATCH /files/{file_id}\ncurrent_version, diff
Gateway -> Auth : Validate token
Auth --> Gateway : user_id

Gateway -> Storage : Edit file\nuser_id, file_id,\ncurrent_version, diff

Storage -> Permission : Check edit access\nuser_id, file_id
Permission -> PermissionDB : Check permissions
PermissionDB --> Permission : allowed / denied
Permission --> Storage : access result

Storage -> ObjectStorage : Read current file
ObjectStorage --> Storage : file content

Storage -> Storage : Create new file version with a diff

Storage -> ObjectStorage : Save new version
ObjectStorage --> Storage : new_object_id

Storage ->> Kafka : FileUpdated event\nfile_id, user_id,\nold_version, new_version,\nobject_id\nnew_object_id

Storage --> Gateway : edit sucessful
Gateway --> App : edit sucessful
App --> User : File saved

par Metadata update
    Kafka ->> Metadata : FileUpdated event
    Metadata -> MetadataDB : Update metadata\ncurrent_version,\nnew_object_id,\nupdated_at, last_editor
    MetadataDB --> Metadata : OK

    else Sync update
    Kafka ->> Sync : FileUpdated event
    Sync -> SyncDB : Add change to changelog\nfile_id, new_version
    SyncDB --> Sync : OK
    note right of Sync
    Device synchronization
    end note

    else Thumbnail update
    Kafka ->> Thumbnail : FileUpdated event
    alt Preview should be updated
         note right of Thumbnail
        Update preview flow
        end note
    end

    else Search indexing
    Kafka ->> Search : FileUpdated event
    Search -> Search : Update Search Index

    else Permission handling
    Kafka ->> Permission : FileUpdated event
    Permission -> PermissionDB : Keep existing permissions\nfor new version
    PermissionDB --> Permission : OK
end


@enduml